(
force_edge_diagram (manual 6.455) outside its displacement range: the
factor is 0 (as force_edge_time outside its times). Mesh and load of
force_edge_diagram1, diagram -1 0 -0.05 0.5 0 1: node 4 settles -0.1 in
the first iteration (factor 0.5*0.9/0.95), node 6 -0.01 (factor 0.9).
Professional 02-08-2026 values. With the diagram -0.05 0.5 0 1 (no
point below -0.05) the Professional gives disy(4) = 0 (factor 0).
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
